message: "If you reference SynapsePipe in research, documentation, or a derivative project, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "SynapsePipe: Next-gen Local-first AIGC Workbench & Creative Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  SynapsePipe is a local-first AIGC workbench combining a structured prompt library,
  an AI prompt expansion studio, and a traceable asset gallery. It runs as a single
  Next.js application with SQLite and Drizzle ORM, and keeps creative data on the user's device.
authors:
  - name: "FanDuck and SynapsePipe contributors"
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-10-28"
license: MIT
